# The key bindings: Open keys.json, which herdr (fake) cannot open in an editor pane.
size 60 20
file README.md # Hello\n
file notes.md text\n
dir src
file src/main.rs fn main() {}\n
state settings.json {"glyphs":"unicode","theme":"dark","updateCheck":false,"follow":false}
start
keys , end up enter
# After the last width check (2500 ms): the editor's calls do not mix with its pane layout ones.
until 2600
keys end enter
until 2900
